o you after visiting Coney Island in New York City, where I ate a hotdog, r=
ode a ferris wheel and enjoyed a quintessentially American summer holiday.<=
/p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Today in tech, we=E2=80=99re examining Ope=
nAI=E2=80=99s new model release and the Silicon Valley=E2=80=99s monopoly p=
ower, and wondering why Brits and Americans have such vastly different opin=
ions about surveillance cameras.</p>
